<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Sekuriti-sekuriti yang dikehendaki diterbitkan menurut seksyen ini—"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3__para_a> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@> .
