<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "hendaklah daripada apa-apa nilai nominal sebagaimana Menteri Kewangan arahkan; dan"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/4/msa@> .
